WEBVTT

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:32.893
There's a large microbial universe
operating in these soil systems.

00:04:33.352 --> 00:04:37.023
They are involved in numerous functions,

00:04:37.064 --> 00:04:41.360
breaking down everything
into individual components,

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:44.780
nourishing our crops to grow
and produce food.

00:04:46.198 --> 00:04:47.408
It's so complex.

00:04:47.408 --> 00:04:51.996
It's much, much bigger
than the ecosystem that we know,

00:04:52.038 --> 00:04:55.458
the ecosystem above
the ground that we know.

00:04:55.499 --> 00:04:57.001
It's much more complex.

00:04:57.585 --> 00:04:59.128
Just to give you an example,

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:05.301
a gram of soil would have
about 10 billion microbial cells.